          "evidence": "Statement quantifies two named systems and A4 supplies T5 for their ordered pair; step 2.1 checks the range and coherence inputs."
        },
        {
          "case": "iff-forward",
          "status": "not_applicable",
          "reason": "The conclusion is existence of a calibrator and comparison hypothesis, not an iff representation."
        },
